      "content": "i get what u mean about the electrical stuff, but it's just so specific. it only happens when i'm having a bad day. like, i'll be sitting there feeling really overwhelmed and suddenly the screen goes fuzzy. i even tried to record it once but the camera glitched right when i got angry. it feels like there's a connection that goes beyond just bad wiring. even if science doesn't \"prove\" it yet, does it feel like something that could be happening on a more subtle, energetic level? like my internal state is just leaking out?",
